  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4112201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Huffman",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411223101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411223101": {
            "id": "411223101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll get it to them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411223102"
            ]
          },
          "411223102": {
            "id": "411223102",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Thank you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112202",
      "subQuestName": "Show the Orders to Mack",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411220201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411220201": {
            "id": "411220201",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Hello. Do you require anything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220202"
            ]
          },
          "411220202": {
            "id": "411220202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here's some Orders for you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220203"
            ]
          },
          "411220203": {
            "id": "411220203",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Orders? Oh my. Let me have a look... Instructions to return to the city and help to settle various matters...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220204"
            ]
          },
          "411220204": {
            "id": "411220204",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Um, so, I could go back to the city, but those two children simply don't want to do the same.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220205"
            ]
          },
          "411220205": {
            "id": "411220205",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "I have no idea where their parents have gone, and I don't want to forcibly bring them back, so I've been stuck here guarding them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220206"
            ]
          },
          "411220206": {
            "id": "411220206",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "If I were to head back under these circumstances, I don't know what I'd do if something happened to them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220207"
            ]
          },
          "411220207": {
            "id": "411220207",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "But I've tried several times to persuade them, and now they won't listen to me at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220208"
            ]
          },
          "411220208": {
            "id": "411220208",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "So... could you help me convince them? Maybe they might listen to you instead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220209"
            ]
          },
          "411220209": {
            "id": "411220209",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "If you can convince them to return to the city, then I too can leave in peace.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220210"
            ]
          },
          "411220210": {
            "id": "411220210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll give it a shot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220211"
            ]
          },
          "411220211": {
            "id": "411220211",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Great, thank you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112203",
      "subQuestName": "Persuade Jill",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411220301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411220301": {
            "id": "411220301",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "Hmm? Is something wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220302"
            ]
          },
          "411220302": {
            "id": "411220302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, here's the situation...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220303"
            ]
          },
          "411220303": {
            "id": "411220303",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "Oh, I know about the meteorites. But... we haven't seen what they look like when they're coming down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220304"
            ]
          },
          "411220304": {
            "id": "411220304",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "Will said he knew a good spot to watch them, so we came here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220305"
            ]
          },
          "411220305": {
            "id": "411220305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You can see them from the city too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220306"
            ]
          },
          "411220306": {
            "id": "411220306",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "But we'd need to go somewhere really high up to see them if we were in the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220307"
            ]
          },
          "411220307": {
            "id": "411220307",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "The guards aren't going to let us to get up that high for sure...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220308"
            ]
          },
          "411220308": {
            "id": "411220308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That nice man over there is willing to help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220309"
            ]
          },
          "411220309": {
            "id": "411220309",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "Eh? You mean that weird old guy there? But the last time he came to talk to us, he looked really nasty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220310"
            ]
          },
          "411220310": {
            "id": "411220310",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "He just wanted us to go back. Didn't say anything else at all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220311"
            ]
          },
          "411220311": {
            "id": "411220311",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "But if he agrees to take us to a really high place to watch the meteorites, I think... I think we can go back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220312"
            ]
          },
          "411220312": {
            "id": "411220312",
            "speakerId": 1597,
            "speakerName": "Jill",
            "text": "But you'd best talk to Will. It was his idea, after all."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112204",
      "subQuestName": "Persuade Will",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411220401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411220401": {
            "id": "411220401",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "Hmm? Hello, is something up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220402"
            ]
          },
          "411220402": {
            "id": "411220402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, here's the situation...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220403"
            ]
          },
          "411220403": {
            "id": "411220403",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "I know, that's why we came out here — to see the meteorites. Don't worry, we'll go back once we've seen them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220404"
            ]
          },
          "411220404": {
            "id": "411220404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You can see them from the city too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220405"
            ]
          },
          "411220405": {
            "id": "411220405",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "But then we'd need to get way up high. I tried lots of times, but the guards kept yelling at me to come down. I got a scolding from them afterwards.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220406"
            ]
          },
          "411220406": {
            "id": "411220406",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "That's why I brought Jill over here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220407"
            ]
          },
          "411220407": {
            "id": "411220407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That nice guard over there will help us out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220408"
            ]
          },
          "411220408": {
            "id": "411220408",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "Help us? Do you mean he can take us to a high point in the city to watch the meteorites?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220409"
            ]
          },
          "411220409": {
            "id": "411220409",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "That can't be... He looks so weird, and angry, too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220410"
            ]
          },
          "411220410": {
            "id": "411220410",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I have his Orders with me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220411"
            ]
          },
          "411220411": {
            "id": "411220411",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "Really? Let me see them! Wow... these really are the official Orders of the Knights!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220412"
            ]
          },
          "411220412": {
            "id": "411220412",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "With this, that man will take us up to see the meteorites, won't he?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220413"
            ]
          },
          "411220413": {
            "id": "411220413",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "Hehe... Watching the meteorites from inside the city would be the best!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220414"
            ]
          },
          "411220414": {
            "id": "411220414",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "Well, you go have a word with him. I'll talk to Jill.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220415"
            ]
          },
          "411220415": {
            "id": "411220415",
            "speakerId": 1598,
            "speakerName": "Will",
            "text": "Ah, I really can't wait... I wanna see the meteorites falling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112205",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Mack",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411220501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411220501": {
            "id": "411220501",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "How did it go? Did you manage to convince them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220502"
            ]
          },
          "411220502": {
            "id": "411220502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, so it would seem...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220503"
            ]
          },
          "411220503": {
            "id": "411220503",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Really? That's great! Thank you so much— actually, wait... What do you mean \"so it would seem\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220504"
            ]
          },
          "411220504": {
            "id": "411220504",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You just need to do your part...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220505"
            ]
          },
          "411220505": {
            "id": "411220505",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "My part? What does that mean...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220506"
            ]
          },
          "411220506": {
            "id": "411220506",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Eh? You want me to take them to the highest point in Mondstadt and watch the meteors fall? That's... rather dangerous.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220507"
            ]
          },
          "411220507": {
            "id": "411220507",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Not to mention that they're kids, too. I'll have to report this to Headquarters first...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220508"
            ]
          },
          "411220508": {
            "id": "411220508",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I've got your Orders right here, you know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220509"
            ]
          },
          "411220509": {
            "id": "411220509",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "That's... not how you use it, I don't think.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220510"
            ]
          },
          "411220510": {
            "id": "411220510",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Well, never mind. As long as we can get those kids back to the city, I'll... I'll figure something out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220511"
            ]
          },
          "411220511": {
            "id": "411220511",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Really?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220512"
            ]
          },
          "411220512": {
            "id": "411220512",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Of course, I swear it on my honor as a knight and... as an adult.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220513"
            ]
          },
          "411220513": {
            "id": "411220513",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "No matter who it is, our word is as good as our bond.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220514"
            ]
          },
          "411220514": {
            "id": "411220514",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Thanks for your help. Leave the rest to me — I'll bring them back to the city shortly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220515"
            ]
          },
          "411220515": {
            "id": "411220515",
            "speakerId": 1561,
            "speakerName": "Mack",
            "text": "Afterwards, I'll figure out how to get them to Mondstadt's highest point..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112206",
      "subQuestName": "Show the Orders to Harry",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411220601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411220601": {
            "id": "411220601",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Hello. Do you need help with anything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220602"
            ]
          },
          "411220602": {
            "id": "411220602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Have a look at these Orders...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220603"
            ]
          },
          "411220603": {
            "id": "411220603",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Orders? Allow me... So, instructions to return to the city, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220604"
            ]
          },
          "411220604": {
            "id": "411220604",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "My apologies, but I will have to execute these duties later, as I still have important matters to attend to.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220605"
            ]
          },
          "411220605": {
            "id": "411220605",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "It seems as if the monsters around these parts have been affected by the meteorites. They've become much more violent, and are exceptionally dangerous.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220606"
            ]
          },
          "411220606": {
            "id": "411220606",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "I have to clean them out in order to ensure this area's safety.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220607"
            ]
          },
          "411220607": {
            "id": "411220607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But there's no one here, is there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220608"
            ]
          },
          "411220608": {
            "id": "411220608",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Well, it's precisely because no one's around that I'm free to fight these monsters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220609"
            ]
          },
          "411220609": {
            "id": "411220609",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "This is a very important matter. I cannot leave while it remains undone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220612"
            ]
          },
          "411220612": {
            "id": "411220612",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Great, thank you. There's not one, but a few concentrations of monsters in this area.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220613"
            ]
          },
          "411220613": {
            "id": "411220613",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Let's split up and destroy all the monsters in our respective areas, and we'll link up here once we're done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112207",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112208",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Harry",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411220801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411220801": {
            "id": "411220801",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Those monsters were really hard to handle...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220802"
            ]
          },
          "411220802": {
            "id": "411220802",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "I've settled matters on my end. How goes it on yours?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220803"
            ]
          },
          "411220803": {
            "id": "411220803",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We're done here as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220804"
            ]
          },
          "411220804": {
            "id": "411220804",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Haha, you've got fine moves, don't you? Thanks so much for your help. I don't think those monsters will return to these parts for a while.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220805"
            ]
          },
          "411220805": {
            "id": "411220805",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Still, I can't return just yet. Other than these monsters, there are still more roaming about in the Stormbearer Mountains.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220806"
            ]
          },
          "411220806": {
            "id": "411220806",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "I want to continue gathering intelligence here — and if someone were to come to harm nearby, I would be on hand to rescue them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220807"
            ]
          },
          "411220807": {
            "id": "411220807",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Not everyone is aware of the call to seek shelter, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220808"
            ]
          },
          "411220808": {
            "id": "411220808",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "Alright, then. Please convey my intent to Mr. Huffman. I'm sure he'll understand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112209",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Huffman",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411226101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411226101": {
            "id": "411226101",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Ah, right, I've made you run about quite a bit, and in these conditions, too. I must thank you properly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411226102"
            ]
          },
          "411226102": {
            "id": "411226102",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Here, take these as thanks. If you haven't any other urgent matters, please stay within the city limits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112201",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411220101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411220101": {
            "id": "411220101",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "*sigh* It seems that we don't have any good options...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220102"
            ]
          },
          "411220102": {
            "id": "411220102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220103"
            ]
          },
          "411220103": {
            "id": "411220103",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Ah, it's you. Well... I'm sure you've seen those falling meteorites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220104"
            ]
          },
          "411220104": {
            "id": "411220104",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "While the city itself has been very fortunate to have avoided any meteorite hits, it's chaos outside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220105"
            ]
          },
          "411220105": {
            "id": "411220105",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Between the people who fled into the city to seek shelter and those who fell unconscious without warning, we've got our hands full here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220106"
            ]
          },
          "411220106": {
            "id": "411220106",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "I'd like to recall all the knights who are currently attending to duties outside so we can settle matters within these four walls first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220107"
            ]
          },
          "411220107": {
            "id": "411220107",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "But they are currently dispersed out in the wild, and we haven't the extra numbers to go out and look for them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411220108"
            ]
          },
          "411220108": {
            "id": "411220108",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Could you lend me a hand and let them have a look at these Orders?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112209",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
