            "id": "411225801",
            "speakerId": 1583,
            "speakerName": "Harry",
            "text": "We have to be on our guard against those monsters..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112259",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411225901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411225901": {
            "id": "411225901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, about Mack...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411225902"
            ]
          },
          "411225902": {
            "id": "411225902",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Oh, he needs to take the kids to the highest point in Mondstadt to watch the meteorites? Haha, that's fine. That's fine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411225903"
            ]
          },
          "411225903": {
            "id": "411225903",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "As long as they come back safely, Mack just needs to report what happens to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411225904"
            ]
          },
          "411225904": {
            "id": "411225904",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Mack's never been good with children. This must have been quite the ride for him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411225905"
            ]
          },
          "411225905": {
            "id": "411225905",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "As for Harry...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411225906"
            ]
          },
          "411225906": {
            "id": "411225906",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Harry... still wants to stand guard in the Stormbearer Mountains?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411225907"
            ]
          },
          "411225907": {
            "id": "411225907",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Hmmm, well, that's fine. If anything were to suddenly occur there, he should be able to report back quickly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411225908"
            ]
          },
          "411225908": {
            "id": "411225908",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "But he can be a bit impulsive. I hope that he can settle this with no mess."
          }
        }
      }
    },
